        "content": "<p>Hello, here is a MWE of a situation where the linter #min_imports wants me to import  BourbakiWitt theorem (which i don't need) starting from a situation where i import Mathlib. If i replace the imports by the one suggested, i can then remove the import of Mathlib.Order.BourbakiWitt. (and by the way at this point #min_imports does not suggests BourbakiWitt anymore)</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compactInsd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Compacts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">setOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">carrier</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">carrier</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">baseChange</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟶</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compactInsd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compactInsd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"n\">hK</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_of_subset_of_mem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">leOfHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">min_imports</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
