    {
        "content": "<p><code>#min_imports</code> has some known false positives: if a proof term uses a very fancy instance, it can result in too strong imports. Replacing such an import by its direct imports can solve this (if that also works, you had such a false positive). I'm not sure if this has an easy fix, sadly.</p>",
